    "module": {
      "purpose": "Provides immer-aware state operator adapters for entity state, enabling mutator functions to work on both plain state and drafts, and to accept raw args or PayloadActions.",
      "summary": "This module exports utilities to create state operators for Redux Toolkit entity adapters. It wraps mutator callbacks so they can be invoked with a state (draft or plain) and an optional argument or FSA action. When the state is an immer draft, the mutator runs in place; otherwise a new immutable state is produced via createNextState. A typed draft guard and FSA detection are included.",
